But Ten[cent may find] its[ main] competition for PUBG on mobile could come from other Chinese companies. NetEase was quick to copy PUBG and released similar games for smartphone while the original was still on PC. NetEase says just one of its[ clones], Knives[ Out,] has over 100 million registered players[ -- far more] than the 40 million playing PUBG on PC and[ Xbox.]

